<mxfile host="app.diagrams.net">
  <diagram name="Top K Leaderboard Context" id="leaderboard-context">
    <mxGraphModel dx="1700" dy="1000" grid="1" gridSize="10" page="1" pageScale="1" pageWidth="1700" pageHeight="1000" background="#ffffff">
      <root>
        <mxCell id="0" />
        <mxCell id="1" parent="0" />
        <mxCell id="title" value="TOP-K LEADERBOARD (Gaming / YouTube Trending / Spotify Charts) - System Context" style="text;html=1;strokeColor=none;fillColor=none;align=center;fontSize=22;fontStyle=1;fontColor=#1a237e" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="60" y="20" width="1580" height="35" as="geometry" /></mxCell>
        <mxCell id="subtitle" value="Real-time score ingestion (1M events/sec) → Redis Sorted Set (ZSET) for instant top-K retrieval (&lt;1ms) → Kafka as source of truth" style="text;html=1;strokeColor=none;fillColor=#e8eaf6;align=center;rounded=1;fontSize=13" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="200" y="65" width="1300" height="28" as="geometry" /></mxCell>

        <mxCell id="boundary" value="TOP-K LEADERBOARD PLATFORM" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#f5f5f5;strokeColor=#ef6c00;strokeWidth=4;fontSize=16;fontStyle=1;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacingTop=10;spacingLeft=15" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="320" y="140" width="1040" height="640" as="geometry" /></mxCell>

        <mxCell id="clients" value="CLIENTS\n\nGame apps, web dashboards\nmobile apps\n\nSubmit scores/views/likes\nQuery top-K rankings\nView personal rank\nSee nearby competitors\nSubscribe to live updates" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#bbdefb;strokeColor=#1976d2;strokeWidth=2;fontSize=12;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacing=10" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="350" y="195" width="230" height="220" as="geometry" /></mxCell>
        <mxCell id="gateway" value="API GATEWAY\n\nAuthentication\nRate limiting\nRouting\nWebSocket connections\n(live push)" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#ffcc80;strokeColor=#ef6c00;strokeWidth=2;fontSize=12;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacing=10" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="640" y="195" width="180" height="150" as="geometry" /></mxCell>
        <mxCell id="services" value="CORE SERVICES\n\nScore Service\n(ingestion, dedup, validation)\n\nRanking Service\n(top-K queries, rank lookup,\nnearby ranks)" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#c8e6c9;strokeColor=#388e3c;strokeWidth=2;fontSize=12;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacing=10" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="870" y="195" width="230" height="150" as="geometry" /></mxCell>
        <mxCell id="storage" value="DATA + EVENTS\n\nKafka: event stream\nRedis ZSET: live rankings\nScore DB: persistent history\nInfluxDB: time-series analytics" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#e1bee7;strokeColor=#7b1fa2;strokeWidth=2;fontSize=12;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacing=10" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="1150" y="195" width="180" height="150" as="geometry" /></mxCell>

        <mxCell id="principles" value="KEY DESIGN RULES\n\n1. Kafka is source of truth: All scores go to Kafka first, never directly to Redis. If Redis crashes, replay Kafka to rebuild all leaderboards from scratch. Redis is a cache built from Kafka events.\n\n2. Redis ZSET for instant top-K: ZINCRBY increments score atomically (no race conditions). ZREVRANGE returns top-K in &lt;1ms from pre-sorted skip list. Time-windowed keys with TTL auto-expire old leaderboards.\n\n3. Score deduplication: Redis key view_dedup:{user_id}:{entity_id} EX 300 prevents same user from inflating counts within 5 minutes. Returns 200 OK but skips Kafka publish.\n\n4. Trending uses time-decay: trending_score = engagement / (age_hours + 2)^1.8. Recent items with moderate engagement beat old items with massive engagement. Batch recompute hourly for last 7 days only.\n\n5. Multi-dimensional key explosion: 5 regions × 10 categories × 4 time windows = 200 leaderboards. Fix: lazy init (create key on first write), EXPIRE unused keys after 30 days, separate Redis cluster per region.\n\n6. Approximate structures for scale: Count-Min Sketch tracks 1 billion items in 1 MB with ~2% overcount error. HyperLogLog counts unique viewers in 12 KB. Bloom Filter tests top-K membership in O(1)." style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#fff3e0;strokeColor=#ef6c00;strokeWidth=2;fontSize=11;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacing=10" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="350" y="465" width="980" height="285" as="geometry" /></mxCell>

        <mxCell id="user" value="PLAYER / VIEWER\n\nSubmits scores\nPlays video\nLikes content\nViews personal rank\nChecks global top-10\nSubscribes to rank updates" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#bbdefb;strokeColor=#1976d2;strokeWidth=3;fontSize=12;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacing=10" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="50" y="230" width="210" height="165" as="geometry" /></mxCell>
        <mxCell id="user-edge" value="Use app or dashboard" style="edgeStyle=orthogonalEdgeStyle;rounded=0;html=1;strokeWidth=3;strokeColor=#1976d2;endArrow=classic;endFill=1;fontSize=10" edge="1" parent="1" source="user" target="boundary"><mxGeometry relative="1" as="geometry" /></mxCell>

        <mxCell id="kafka" value="KAFKA\n\nscore.updated topic\nPartition by entity_id hash\nRetains 7 days for replay\n100 partitions for throughput" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#e1bee7;strokeColor=#7b1fa2;strokeWidth=3;fontSize=12;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacing=10" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="1420" y="180" width="220" height="145" as="geometry" /></mxCell>
        <mxCell id="kafka-edge" value="Publish score events" style="edgeStyle=orthogonalEdgeStyle;rounded=0;html=1;strokeWidth=3;strokeColor=#7b1fa2;endArrow=classic;endFill=1;startArrow=classic;startFill=1;fontSize=10" edge="1" parent="1" source="boundary" target="kafka"><mxGeometry relative="1" as="geometry" /></mxCell>

        <mxCell id="redis" value="REDIS ZSET\n\nPre-sorted rankings\nZINCRBY atomic increment\nZREVRANGE top-K in &lt;1ms\nTime-windowed keys with TTL" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#fff9c4;strokeColor=#f57f17;strokeWidth=3;fontSize=12;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacing=10" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="1420" y="380" width="220" height="145" as="geometry" /></mxCell>
        <mxCell id="redis-edge" value="Read rankings (fast path)" style="edgeStyle=orthogonalEdgeStyle;rounded=0;html=1;strokeWidth=3;strokeColor=#f57f17;endArrow=classic;endFill=1;startArrow=classic;startFill=1;fontSize=10" edge="1" parent="1" source="boundary" target="redis"><mxGeometry relative="1" as="geometry" /></mxCell>

        <mxCell id="admin" value="ADMIN / ANALYST\n\nCreate leaderboards\nDelete fraudulent scores\nQuery historical trends\nView analytics dashboard" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#e8f5e9;strokeColor=#388e3c;strokeWidth=3;fontSize=12;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacing=10" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="50" y="450" width="210" height="125" as="geometry" /></mxCell>
        <mxCell id="admin-edge" value="Admin API" style="edgeStyle=orthogonalEdgeStyle;rounded=0;html=1;strokeWidth=2;strokeColor=#388e3c;dashed=1;endArrow=classic;endFill=1;fontSize=10" edge="1" parent="1" source="admin" target="boundary"><mxGeometry relative="1" as="geometry" /></mxCell>

        <mxCell id="influxdb" value="INFLUXDB\n\nTime-series analytics\nHistorical trends\nContinuous aggregation\nDownsampled rollups" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#fce4ec;strokeColor=#c2185b;strokeWidth=3;fontSize=12;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacing=10" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="1420" y="580" width="220" height="125" as="geometry" /></mxCell>
        <mxCell id="influx-edge" value="Analytics queries" style="edgeStyle=orthogonalEdgeStyle;rounded=0;html=1;strokeWidth=2;strokeColor=#c2185b;dashed=1;endArrow=classic;endFill=1;fontSize=10" edge="1" parent="1" source="boundary" target="influxdb"><mxGeometry relative="1" as="geometry" /></mxCell>

        <mxCell id="analogy" value="BEGINNER ANALOGY: The platform is a live sports scoreboard at a stadium. Kafka is the officials reporting every play instantly to the master scorebook. Redis ZSET is the giant LED board that updates in real-time with top teams. The Score DB is the archive vault with every game's full history. InfluxDB is the stats room where analysts compute weekly averages and season trends. If the LED board (Redis) goes dark, you rebuild it from the master scorebook (Kafka). The crowd (clients) sees the board update live and never knows the backend complexity." style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#e1f5fe;strokeColor=#0277bd;strokeWidth=2;fontSize=11;align=left;verticalAlign=middle;spacing=10" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="50" y="840" width="1590" height="95" as="geometry" /></mxCell>
      </root>
    </mxGraphModel>
  </diagram>
</mxfile>
